e_id":"RA_kwDORZ9jAc4gw3Lp","name":"CliRelay_0.5.1_linux_amd64.tar.gz","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/gzip","state":"uploaded","size":16375265,"digest":"sha256:f120f115ca3fe0399afaecf040a534bb1a8770a508edc0d21592a0ce58cbb2fd","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-09-08T01:38:23Z","updated_at":"2026-09-08T01:38:24Z"},{"id":549679835,"node_id":"RA_kwDORZ9jAc4gw3Lb","name":"CliRelay_0.5.1_linux_arm64.tar.gz","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/gzip","state":"uploaded","size":15027194,"digest":"sha256:cb263f270fc35f3569a8f1f1712225521feae9ae3bb9b3be9a7834292791cd60","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-09-08T01:38:21Z","updated_at":"2026-09-08T01:38:22Z"},{"id":549679845,"node_id":"RA_kwDORZ9jAc4gw3Ll","name":"CliRelay_0.5.1_windows_amd64.zip","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":16721358,"digest":"sha256:18be81fb70dadff6254944653469b3be7657f3f715af011cdb15e1bed87cf5f2","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-09-08T01:38:23Z","updated_at":"2026-09-08T01:38:24Z"},{"id":549679834,"node_id":"RA_kwDORZ9jAc4gw3La","name":"CliRelay_0.5.1_windows_arm64.zip","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":15154282,"digest":"sha256:174c3239be6162888a8b3eb6e71f652ed6e0d9efbd365ba28f2fd91fddc7ff22","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-09-08T01:38:21Z","updated_at":"2026-09-08T01:38:22Z"}],"body":"# v0.5.1 - Codex 原生网页搜索修复 / Native Codex Web Search Fix\n\n## 核心更新亮点 / Highlights\n\n### 1. 接通 Codex 原生网页搜索 / Native Codex Web Search\n\n* **修复搜索 404**：Codex CLI 和 Desktop 的原生网页搜索请求可以使用独立搜索接口，支持标准路径和渠道分组路径。\n* **搜索内容完整保留**：保留搜索命令、设置和结果，避免聊天协议转换加入上游不支持的字段。\n\n### 2. 搜索凭据与权限 / Search Credentials and Permissions\n\n* **按能力选择凭据**：支持 Codex OAuth；API key 上游需要显式设置 `alpha-search: true` 和 `base-url`，开关支持保存及热更新。\n* **沿用现有权限**：搜索继续遵守租户、模型、渠道和客户端限制，没有可用搜索凭据时返回明确错误。\n\n---\n\n## 详细改动记录 / Detailed Changes\n\n### 后端 CliRelay\n\n- **fix(codex)**：接入独立 `POST /v1/alpha/search` 协议，保留模型别名、请求取消、错误和用量记录；移除顶层 `prompt_cache_key` 与 `prompt_cache_retention`。\n- **fix(identity)**：修复后台旧快照覆盖新学习指纹的竞态，避免连续请求意外切回默认客户端指纹。\n- **fix(config)**：补齐搜索能力开关的 YAML、管理接口、持久化和热更新，API key 默认关闭搜索能力。\n\n本次仅更新后端，管理面板继续使用 v0.5.0。请求必须包含 `model`，不支持流式搜索；API key 上游需要自行提供对应搜索协议。回归验证使用本地 HTTP 服务和模拟 OAuth 传输，未使用真实官方账号实测搜索。\n\nFixes #994 via #1009.\n"}
